Description: KPhotoAlbum's per-file 3D entries are the stereo layer's menu and store (ORDER 551b)
 The viewer's 3D menu shows Stereo::FileChoiceMenu, and the choices (the input packing, Not 3D, the swap) are kept in the
 layer's per-file store, which Dolphin, the thumbnailers and Gwenview read; the viewer keeps which eye is shown, and the
 choice follows a renamed or moved file. Needs libstereo-layer-dev (>= 1.19.0).
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-14
